// Things Jemery says to himself in the swamp ([ai_timer,jemery_mclabe])
[mclabe_quotes]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=0,Danvid? Bellamy? Hello?
val=1,I'm sure they were around here somewhere.
val=2,This swamp is very... swampy.
val=3,Mum always said: stick together, boys.
val=4,That rat looked at me funny.
val=5,Is this the way to Lumbridge? Was it ever?
